1
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:18,635
[Host] Welcome to Japanese Daily News. I'm Maya. Today is May twenty-sixth. Today's story is big: the Japanese government wants to cut the sales tax on food all the way down to zero. This affects everyone who eats in Japan. Let's listen.

2
00:00:19,236 --> 00:00:27,899
[News] 日本政府は、食料品の消費税をゼロパーセントにする方針を発表しました。

3
00:00:28,600 --> 00:00:44,368
[News] 今、日本の消費税は10パーセントです。食料品は8パーセントの軽減税率が適用されています。これをゼロにする計画です。

4
00:00:45,067 --> 00:01:00,692
[News] 高市早苗首相は、「物価が高くなって、国民の生活が苦しくなっている。食べ物の税金をなくすことで、家計を助けたい」と話しました。

5
00:01:01,392 --> 00:01:15,959
[News] この減税は二年間の期間限定です。まず、国会で法案を提出して、早ければ二千二十六年度中に始まる予定です。

6
00:01:16,659 --> 00:01:30,340
[News] 例えば、今まで百八円だったおにぎりが、百円になります。千八十円だった食料品の買い物が、千円になります。

7
00:01:31,040 --> 00:01:42,799
[News] ただし、お酒と外食は対象外です。スーパーやコンビニで買う食べ物と飲み物だけが対象になります。

8
00:01:43,500 --> 00:01:52,835
[News] 野党からは、「ゼロではなく、すべての消費税を下げるべきだ」という意見も出ています。

9
00:01:53,536 --> 00:01:55,168
[Host] Let's break it down.

10
00:01:55,768 --> 00:01:57,328
[Host] The opening line.

11
00:01:57,927 --> 00:02:07,816
[Slow] 日本政府は、食料品の消費税をゼロパーセントにする方針を発表しました。

12
00:02:08,616 --> 00:02:15,864
[Host] The Japanese government announced a plan to make the sales tax on food zero percent. Let's look at the key words.

13
00:02:16,463 --> 00:02:19,199
[Vocab] 食料品

14
00:02:19,599 --> 00:02:26,319
[Host] Food products, groceries. This covers rice, vegetables, snacks. Anything you eat.

15
00:02:26,919 --> 00:02:29,463
[Vocab] 消費税

16
00:02:29,864 --> 00:02:37,111
[Host] Consumption tax. Japan calls its sales tax this way. Right now it's ten percent on most things.

17
00:02:37,711 --> 00:02:40,039
[Vocab] 方針

18
00:02:40,439 --> 00:02:48,431
[Host] Policy or plan. When the government uses this word, it means they've decided on a direction but haven't passed a law yet.

19
00:02:49,032 --> 00:02:50,903
[Host] The current situation.

20
00:02:51,503 --> 00:02:59,639
[Slow] 食料品は8パーセントの軽減税率が適用されています。

21
00:03:00,439 --> 00:03:04,951
[Host] A reduced tax rate of eight percent is being applied to food products.

22
00:03:05,551 --> 00:03:08,623
[Vocab] 軽減税率

23
00:03:09,024 --> 00:03:17,759
[Host] Reduced tax rate. The first part means reduction. The second part means tax rate. Together: a lightened tax rate.

24
00:03:18,360 --> 00:03:19,919
[Host] Why does this matter?

25
00:03:20,520 --> 00:03:27,864
[Slow] 物価が高くなって、国民の生活が苦しくなっている。

26
00:03:28,663 --> 00:03:33,271
[Host] Prices have gone up, and people's daily lives have become difficult.

27
00:03:33,872 --> 00:03:36,032
[Vocab] 物価

28
00:03:36,431 --> 00:03:43,919
[Host] Price level. Not the price of one item, but prices in general. Very common in news about economics.

29
00:03:44,520 --> 00:03:46,919
[Vocab] 苦しい

30
00:03:47,319 --> 00:03:53,872
[Host] Tough, painful, difficult. Used for physical pain, but also financial hardship.

31
00:03:54,472 --> 00:03:56,415
[Host] A concrete example.

32
00:03:57,015 --> 00:04:03,807
[Slow] 今まで百八円だったおにぎりが、百円になります。

33
00:04:04,608 --> 00:04:14,903
[Host] An onigiri that cost one hundred and eight yen will become one hundred yen. Eight yen doesn't sound like much, but it adds up across every grocery trip.

34
00:04:15,503 --> 00:04:17,807
[Vocab] 今まで

35
00:04:18,208 --> 00:04:25,552
[Host] Until now. A time expression you'll use constantly. It marks the before in a before-and-after comparison.

36
00:04:26,151 --> 00:04:27,687
[Host] But there's a catch.

37
00:04:28,288 --> 00:04:34,024
[Slow] ただし、お酒と外食は対象外です。

38
00:04:34,824 --> 00:04:38,351
[Host] However, alcohol and eating out are excluded.

39
00:04:38,951 --> 00:04:41,255
[Vocab] ただし

40
00:04:41,656 --> 00:04:49,408
[Host] However. This is the formal version. In news and official documents, you'll always hear this word.

41
00:04:50,007 --> 00:04:52,600
[Vocab] 対象外

42
00:04:53,000 --> 00:05:02,384
[Host] Outside the scope, excluded. Remove the last character and it means target or covered. So only groceries you take home are included.

43
00:05:02,983 --> 00:05:05,576
[Host] And the opposition had something to say.

44
00:05:06,175 --> 00:05:14,576
[Slow] 野党からは、すべての消費税を下げるべきだという意見も出ています。

45
00:05:15,375 --> 00:05:20,896
[Host] The opposition parties say they should lower all consumption tax, not just on food.

46
00:05:21,495 --> 00:05:23,656
[Vocab] べきだ

47
00:05:24,055 --> 00:05:30,680
[Host] Should do. It expresses a strong opinion. Very common in news and editorials.

48
00:05:31,279 --> 00:05:34,279
[Host] Let's listen to the full story one more time.

49
00:05:34,879 --> 00:05:43,543
[News] 日本政府は、食料品の消費税をゼロパーセントにする方針を発表しました。

50
00:05:44,244 --> 00:06:00,012
[News] 今、日本の消費税は10パーセントです。食料品は8パーセントの軽減税率が適用されています。これをゼロにする計画です。

51
00:06:00,711 --> 00:06:16,336
[News] 高市早苗首相は、「物価が高くなって、国民の生活が苦しくなっている。食べ物の税金をなくすことで、家計を助けたい」と話しました。

52
00:06:17,036 --> 00:06:31,603
[News] この減税は二年間の期間限定です。まず、国会で法案を提出して、早ければ二千二十六年度中に始まる予定です。

53
00:06:32,303 --> 00:06:45,983
[News] 例えば、今まで百八円だったおにぎりが、百円になります。千八十円だった食料品の買い物が、千円になります。

54
00:06:46,684 --> 00:06:58,444
[News] ただし、お酒と外食は対象外です。スーパーやコンビニで買う食べ物と飲み物だけが対象になります。

55
00:06:59,144 --> 00:07:08,480
[News] 野党からは、「ゼロではなく、すべての消費税を下げるべきだ」という意見も出ています。

56
00:07:09,180 --> 00:07:11,915
[Host] Quiz time. Three questions.

57
00:07:12,516 --> 00:07:19,235
[Slow] 今、食料品の消費税は何パーセントですか？

58
00:07:20,036 --> 00:07:26,108
[Host] What is the current sales tax on food? Eight percent. The plan is to take it to zero.

59
00:07:26,708 --> 00:07:30,283
[Slow] お酒は対象ですか？

60
00:07:31,084 --> 00:07:35,115
[Host] Is alcohol included? No. It's excluded.

61
00:07:35,716 --> 00:07:40,108
[Slow] この減税は何年間ですか？

62
00:07:40,908 --> 00:07:44,939
[Host] How many years will this tax cut last? Two years.

63
00:07:45,540 --> 00:07:47,459
[Host] Vocabulary recap.

64
00:07:48,060 --> 00:07:50,795
[Vocab] 食料品

65
00:07:51,196 --> 00:07:53,500
[Host] Food products, groceries.

66
00:07:54,100 --> 00:07:56,644
[Vocab] 消費税

67
00:07:57,043 --> 00:07:58,819
[Host] Consumption tax.

68
00:07:59,420 --> 00:08:02,492
[Vocab] 軽減税率

69
00:08:02,891 --> 00:08:04,572
[Host] Reduced tax rate.

70
00:08:05,172 --> 00:08:07,331
[Vocab] 物価

71
00:08:07,732 --> 00:08:09,052
[Host] Price level.

72
00:08:09,651 --> 00:08:12,052
[Vocab] 苦しい

73
00:08:12,451 --> 00:08:14,324
[Host] Tough, difficult.

74
00:08:14,923 --> 00:08:17,228
[Vocab] ただし

75
00:08:17,627 --> 00:08:18,875
[Host] However.

76
00:08:19,475 --> 00:08:22,067
[Vocab] 対象外

77
00:08:22,468 --> 00:08:23,764
[Host] Excluded.

78
00:08:24,363 --> 00:08:36,748
[Host] That's today's Japanese Daily News. Full transcript with furigana at podcast.jpnotes.dev. Subscribe on Apple Podcasts or Spotify. See you tomorrow.

79
00:08:37,347 --> 00:08:39,604
[News] また明日。
